// ============================================================================
// hipaa.dl -- entry point for the HIPAA formalization
// ============================================================================
// Includes every module in the same dependency order the original
// COMPLIANCEGPT-V1 manifest (connector/regulation_manifest.py,
// REGULATION_FILES["hipaa"]) used: types/hierarchy/macros/stubs first,
// section-specific rules next, hipaa_top.dl (the top-level
// is_disclosure_allowed rule that ties everything together) last.
//
// Run with:
//     souffle -D <output_dir> souffle/hipaa.dl
// ============================================================================

